+# Printer Controls Section — Design Specification
+
+**Issue:** [#283](https://github.com/OlyForge3D/PrintFarmer/issues/283)  
+**Author:** Newt (Industrial UI Designer)  
+**Date:** 2026-05-28  
+**Status:** Ready for Implementation
+
+## Overview
+
+This document specifies the UI design for the **Printer Controls** section in `PrinterDetailView.swift`. The section contains three subgroups: **Preheat**, **Home**, and **Jog** — providing operators with quick access to common maintenance tasks.
+
+### Design Principles
+
+- **Industrial precision:** Clear, data-forward controls with unambiguous labels
+- **Dark-first:** Designed for `pfBackground` (#0b1020) with appropriate contrast
+- **Accessible:** WCAG 2.2 AA compliant, color-blind friendly disabled states
+- **HIG compliant:** All touch targets ≥44pt per Apple Human Interface Guidelines
+
+---
+
+## Section Placement
+
+### Phone (Compact Width)
+
+The Controls section appears in `printerContent(_:)` **after** `actionSection` and **before** the view's bottom padding. It is rendered only when `printer.isOnline == true`.
+
+```
+┌────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│ Header Section                         │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Temperatures Section                   │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Current Job (if printing/paused)       │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Camera Section                         │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Failure Detection (if active)          │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Filament Section                       │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Auto-Dispatch Section                  │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Predictive Insights Link               │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ Action Section (pause/resume/stop)     │
+├────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│ ▶ CONTROLS SECTION (new)               │  ← NEW
+│   ├ Preheat Subgroup                   │
+│   ├ Home Subgroup                      │
+│   └ Jog Subgroup                       │
+└────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### iPad (Regular Width — 2-Column)
+
+In `iPadPrinterContent(_:)`, allocate Controls to the **left column** below Action Section:
+
+| Left Column | Right Column |
+|-------------|--------------|
+| Header | Camera |
+| Temperatures | Current Job |
+| Filament | Failure Detection |
+| Auto-Dispatch | |
+| Predictive Insights | |
+| Action Section | |
+| **Controls Section** | |
+
+---
+
+## Section Container
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Controls                                    [header]   │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │
+│  │  Preheat Subgroup                               │    │
+│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │
+│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │
+│  │  Home Subgroup                                  │    │
+│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │
+│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │
+│  │  Jog Subgroup                                   │    │
+│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │
+└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### Container Styling
+
+```swift
+VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 12) {
+    Text("Controls")
+        .font(.headline)
+    
+    // Preheat subgroup
+    // Home subgroup
+    // Jog subgroup
+}
+```
+
+- **Section spacing:** 12pt between subgroups
+- **No outer card:** Subgroups have their own card backgrounds
+
+---
+
+## Preheat Subgroup
+
+### Layout — List Style (Recommended)
+
+A vertical list provides clear temperature readouts and sufficient touch targets.
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Preheat                                                │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
+│  │ [🔥] PLA                               200° / 60° │  │
+│  ├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │
+│  │ [🔥] PETG                             240° / 80°  │  │
+│  ├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │
+│  │ [🔥] ABS                              240° / 100° │  │
+│  ├───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  │
+│  │ [❄️] Cool Down                          0° / 0°   │  │
+│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
+└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### Component Anatomy
+
+```swift
+// PreheatRow — individual button row
+HStack {
+    Image(systemName: isCoolDown ? "snowflake" : "flame.fill")
+        .font(.body)
+        .foregroundStyle(isCoolDown ? Color.pfSecondaryAccent : Color.pfWarning)
+        .frame(width: 24)
+    
+    Text(materialName)                    // "PLA", "PETG", "ABS", "Cool Down"
+        .font(.subheadline.weight(.medium))
+    
+    Spacer()
+    
+    Text("\(hotendTemp)° / \(bedTemp)°")  // "200° / 60°"
+        .font(.subheadline.monospacedDigit())
+        .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextSecondary)
+}
+.frame(minHeight: 44)                     // HIG touch target
+.contentShape(Rectangle())               // Full row tappable
+```
+
+### Presets (v1 Locked)
+
+| Material | Hotend | Bed | Icon |
+|----------|--------|-----|------|
+| PLA | 200°C | 60°C | `flame.fill` (pfWarning) |
+| PETG | 240°C | 80°C | `flame.fill` (pfWarning) |
+| ABS | 240°C | 100°C | `flame.fill` (pfWarning) |
+| Cool Down | 0°C | 0°C | `snowflake` (pfSecondaryAccent) |
+
+### Card Styling
+
+```swift
+VStack(spacing: 0) {
+    ForEach(presets) { preset in
+        PreheatRow(preset: preset, isDisabled: isDisabled, isPending: pendingPreset == preset)
+            .onTapGesture { /* call setTemps */ }
+        
+        if preset != presets.last {
+            Divider()
+                .padding(.leading, 36)  // Align with text, not icon
+        }
+    }
+}
+.padding(.vertical, 4)
+.background(Color.pfCard, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))
+.overlay(
+    RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12)
+        .strokeBorder(Color.pfBorder, lineWidth: 1)
+)
+```
+
+---
+
+## Home Subgroup
+
+### Layout — Horizontal Button Row
+
+Three equally-sized buttons in a single row.
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Home                                                   │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│  ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐     │
+│  │   Home All   │ │   Home XY    │ │   Home Z     │     │
+│  │     [🏠]     │ │    [↔️]      │ │    [↕️]      │     │
+│  └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘ └──────────────┘     │
+└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### Component Anatomy
+
+```swift
+HStack(spacing: 10) {
+    HomeButton(label: "Home All", icon: "house.fill", action: homeAll)
+    HomeButton(label: "Home XY", icon: "arrow.left.and.right", action: homeXY)
+    HomeButton(label: "Home Z", icon: "arrow.up.and.down", action: homeZ)
+}
+```
+
+### HomeButton View
+
+```swift
+Button(action: action) {
+    VStack(spacing: 6) {
+        Image(systemName: icon)
+            .font(.title3)
+        Text(label)
+            .font(.caption.weight(.medium))
+    }
+    .frame(maxWidth: .infinity)
+    .frame(height: 60)                    // Above 44pt minimum
+}
+.buttonStyle(.bordered)
+.tint(Color.pfAccent)
+.disabled(isDisabled)
+```
+
+### Button Specifications
+
+| Button | Icon | API Call |
+|--------|------|----------|
+| Home All | `house.fill` | `POST /api/printers/{id}/home` (all axes) |
+| Home XY | `arrow.left.and.right` | `POST /api/printers/{id}/home` (X, Y) |
+| Home Z | `arrow.up.and.down` | `POST /api/printers/{id}/home` (Z) |
+
+- **Touch target:** 60pt height × flexible width (≥44pt per button)
+- **Spacing:** 10pt between buttons
+- **Button style:** `.bordered` with `.pfAccent` tint
+
+---
+
+## Jog Subgroup
+
+### Layout — Segmented Pickers + Action Buttons
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│  Jog                                                    │
+├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
+│                                                         │
+│  Axis                                                   │
+│  ┌─────────┬─────────┬─────────┐                        │
+│  │    X    │    Y    │    Z    │  ← Segmented Picker    │
+│  └─────────┴─────────┴─────────┘                        │
+│                                                         │
+│  Step (mm)                                              │
+│  ┌───────┬───────┬───────┬───────┐                      │
+│  │  0.1  │   1   │  10   │  100  │  ← Segmented Picker  │
+│  └───────┴───────┴───────┴───────┘                      │
+│                                                         │
+│  ┌───────────────────┐  ┌───────────────────┐           │
+│  │        −          │  │         +         │           │
+│  │  Move X −10mm     │  │   Move X +10mm    │           │
+│  └───────────────────┘  └───────────────────┘           │
+│                                                         │
+└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+### Component Anatomy
+
+```swift
+VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 16) {
+    // Axis picker
+    VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 6) {
+        Text("Axis")
+            .font(.caption)
+            .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextSecondary)
+        
+        Picker("Axis", selection: $selectedAxis) {
+            Text("X").tag(Axis.x)
+            Text("Y").tag(Axis.y)
+            Text("Z").tag(Axis.z)
+        }
+        .pickerStyle(.segmented)
+    }
+    
+    // Step picker
+    VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 6) {
+        Text("Step (mm)")
+            .font(.caption)
+            .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextSecondary)
+        
+        Picker("Step", selection: $selectedStep) {
+            Text("0.1").tag(0.1)
+            Text("1").tag(1.0)
+            Text("10").tag(10.0)
+            Text("100").tag(100.0)
+        }
+        .pickerStyle(.segmented)
+    }
+    
+    // Move buttons
+    HStack(spacing: 12) {
+        JogButton(direction: .minus, axis: selectedAxis, step: selectedStep)
+        JogButton(direction: .plus, axis: selectedAxis, step: selectedStep)
+    }
+}
+.padding()
+.background(Color.pfCard, in: RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))
+.overlay(
+    RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12)
+        .strokeBorder(Color.pfBorder, lineWidth: 1)
+)
+```
+
+### JogButton View
+
+```swift
+Button(action: action) {
+    VStack(spacing: 4) {
+        Image(systemName: direction == .minus ? "minus" : "plus")
+            .font(.title2.weight(.semibold))
+        
+        Text("Move \(axis.label) \(direction == .minus ? "−" : "+")\(Int(step))mm")
+            .font(.caption)
+            .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextSecondary)
+    }
+    .frame(maxWidth: .infinity)
+    .frame(height: 56)                    // Above 44pt minimum
+}
+.buttonStyle(.bordered)
+.tint(Color.pfAccent)
+.disabled(isDisabled)
+```
+
+### Jog Specifications
+
+| Setting | Options | Default |
+|---------|---------|---------|
+| Axis | X, Y, Z | X |
+| Step | 0.1, 1, 10, 100 mm | 10 |
+| Feedrate XY | 3000 mm/min | (not surfaced) |
+| Feedrate Z | 600 mm/min | (not surfaced) |
+
+- **Touch target:** Jog buttons are 56pt tall
+- **Segmented pickers:** Use native `.segmented` style (HIG compliant)
+
+---
+
+## States
+
+### State Matrix
+
+| State | Preheat | Home | Jog | Section Visibility |
+|-------|---------|------|-----|-------------------|
+| **Idle** (online, not printing) | Enabled | Enabled | Enabled | Visible |
+| **Pending** (action in flight) | Spinner + dim | Spinner + dim | Spinner + dim | Visible |
+| **Printing / Paused** | Disabled | Disabled | Disabled | Visible |
+| **Offline** | — | — | — | **Hidden** |
+
+### Idle State
+
+- All controls interactive
+- Standard color tokens (`pfCard`, `pfAccent`, `pfTextPrimary`)
+
+### Pending State
+
+When an action is in flight (e.g., waiting for backend response):
+
+```swift
+// PreheatRow with pending state
+HStack {
+    if isPending {
+        ProgressView()
+            .frame(width: 24, height: 24)
+    } else {
+        Image(systemName: icon)
+            .frame(width: 24)
+    }
+    
+    Text(materialName)
+        .foregroundStyle(isPending ? Color.pfTextTertiary : Color.pfTextPrimary)
+    
+    Spacer()
+    
+    Text(tempLabel)
+        .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextTertiary)
+}
+.opacity(isPending ? 0.6 : 1.0)
+.disabled(isPending)
+```
+
+**Pending visual treatment:**
+- Replace icon with `ProgressView()` spinner
+- Opacity: `0.6`
+- Text color: `pfTextTertiary`
+- Interaction: disabled
+
+### Disabled-While-Printing State
+
+When `printer.state ∈ {Printing, Pausing, Paused, Resuming, Cancelling, Heating}`:
+
+```swift
+// DisabledControlRow
+HStack {
+    Image(systemName: icon)
+        .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextTertiary)
+        .frame(width: 24)
+    
+    Text(label)
+        .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextTertiary)
+    
+    Spacer()
+    
+    // Add lock icon for color-blind accessibility
+    Image(systemName: "lock.fill")
+        .font(.caption2)
+        .foregroundStyle(Color.pfTextTertiary)
+}
+.opacity(0.5)
+.disabled(true)
+```
+
+**Disabled visual treatment (color-blind friendly):**
+- Opacity: `0.5`
+- Text/icon color: `pfTextTertiary`
+- **Lock icon:** Small `lock.fill` at trailing edge — provides non-color indicator
+- No interaction
+
+### Hidden-While-Offline State
+
+The entire Controls section is conditionally rendered:
+
+```swift
+// In printerContent(_:)
+if printer.isOnline {
+    controlsSection(printer)
+}
+```
+
+When `printer.isOnline == false`, the section does not render at all.
+
