+
+## Accessibility
+
+### VoiceOver Labels
+
+| Control | Label | Hint |
+|---------|-------|------|
+| PLA row | "Preheat PLA, 200 degrees hotend, 60 degrees bed" | "Double-tap to preheat" |
+| PETG row | "Preheat PETG, 240 degrees hotend, 80 degrees bed" | "Double-tap to preheat" |
+| ABS row | "Preheat ABS, 240 degrees hotend, 100 degrees bed" | "Double-tap to preheat" |
+| Cool Down | "Cool down, turn off heaters" | "Double-tap to cool down" |
+| Home All | "Home all axes" | "Double-tap to home printer" |
+| Home XY | "Home X and Y axes" | "Double-tap to home XY" |
+| Home Z | "Home Z axis" | "Double-tap to home Z" |
+| Axis picker | "Axis, currently \(axis)" | "Swipe to change axis" |
+| Step picker | "Step size, currently \(step) millimeters" | "Swipe to change step" |
+| Jog − | "Move \(axis) minus \(step) millimeters" | "Double-tap to jog" |
+| Jog + | "Move \(axis) plus \(step) millimeters" | "Double-tap to jog" |
+| Disabled control | "[label], unavailable during print" | — |
+
+### Implementation
+
+```swift
+.accessibilityLabel("Preheat PLA, 200 degrees hotend, 60 degrees bed")
+.accessibilityHint(isDisabled ? nil : "Double-tap to preheat")
+.accessibilityAddTraits(isDisabled ? .isStaticText : .isButton)
+```
+
+### Minimum Contrast Ratios
+
+All text meets WCAG 2.2 AA:
+- `pfTextPrimary` on `pfCard`: **7.2:1** (dark), **12.1:1** (light)
+- `pfTextSecondary` on `pfCard`: **4.6:1** (dark), **7.1:1** (light)
+- `pfTextTertiary` on `pfCard`: **3.8:1** — used only for disabled, meets accessibility exception
+
+### Color-Blind Friendly Disabled
+
+**Do not rely on color alone.** Disabled state uses:
+1. Reduced opacity (0.5)
+2. Tertiary text color
+3. **Lock icon** (`lock.fill`) — shape-based indicator
+
+---
+
+## HIG Compliance Checklist
+
+- [x] **Touch targets ≥44pt:** All buttons meet or exceed 44pt height
+  - Preheat rows: 44pt min height
+  - Home buttons: 60pt height
+  - Jog buttons: 56pt height
+  - Segmented pickers: native (≥44pt)
+- [x] **Dark Mode:** All colors use adaptive `pf*` tokens from `ThemeColors.swift`
+- [x] **Dynamic Type:** Use system font styles (`.headline`, `.subheadline`, `.caption`)
+- [x] **Haptics:** Use `UIImpactFeedbackGenerator(.medium)` on button press
+- [x] **Loading indicators:** Native `ProgressView()` for pending state
+
+---
+
+## File Structure
+
+```
+PrintFarmer/
+└── Views/
+    └── Components/
+        └── PrinterControls/           ← NEW DIRECTORY
+            ├── ControlsSection.swift   // Main section container
+            ├── PreheatSubgroup.swift   // Preheat list
+            ├── HomeSubgroup.swift      // Home buttons
+            └── JogSubgroup.swift       // Jog pickers + buttons
+```
+
+---
+
+## Implementation Notes
+
+1. **State management:** Add `@State` properties to `PrinterDetailViewModel`:
+   - `isPreheatPending: Bool`
+   - `pendingPreheatPreset: PreheatPreset?`
+   - `isHomePending: Bool`
+   - `isJogPending: Bool`
+   - `selectedJogAxis: Axis = .x`
+   - `selectedJogStep: Double = 10.0`
+
+2. **Print-state blocking:** Check `viewModel.isPrinting || viewModel.isPaused` (or expanded set per spike #279) to disable controls.
+
+3. **API calls:** Use existing `PrinterService` methods or add new ones for `/temps`, `/home`, `/move`.
+
+4. **SignalR updates:** No optimistic UI — wait for `printerupdated` to confirm temp changes.
+
